Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 5.4 038/459] media: sun4i-csi: Fix data sampling polarity handling
Date:   Fri, 14 Feb 2020 10:54:48 -0500
Message-Id: <20200214160149.11681-38-sashal@kernel.org>
